  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Arrange the following in increasing order of their covalent character.</p><p>(A)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>(B) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>(C)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaBr</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>(D)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaI</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below.</p>",
